    "v97": "protocol97.py/Rust gateway and standalone cu66-v97-forward ingress provide setup, fragment, credit, ACK, cancellation, CRC and ingress commit. Protocol is 40-byte setup/ACK, 12-byte common fragment header + 16-byte first fragment metadata, 1024/1400 payloads, opaque profile cap 49152 bytes, 2048-byte standalone ingress FIFO/two descriptors. This ingress is parallel command/DMA, not physical QSPI and does not decode/publish. Production register map does not expose this contract.",
